<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="repo-icon.png" name="A.O.Jarvis" pubkey="" timestamp="1795835446" url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis/gh-pages/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Repositório F-Droid oficial do aplicativo A.O.Jarvis Android (Dazzlly/A.O.Jarvis).</description></repo><application id="com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx"><id>com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx</id><added>2026-11-28</added><lastupdated>2026-11-28</lastupdated><name>A.O.Jarvis</name><summary>Android voice assistant with Gemini, local Wi-Fi Ollama, and offline voice mode.</summary><icon>com.aistudio.openjarvis.vkmqrx.7.png</icon><desc>A.O.Jarvis is a local-first Android personal voice assistant combining Gemini Cloud (via Firebase AI Logic), a local Ollama server over Wi-Fi, and offline voice commands.

Key features:
- Native Android SpeechRecognizer with offline support, lightweight &quot;Hey Jarvis&quot; AudioRecord wake-word detection, and customizable Text-to-Speech (TTS).
- Persistent Foreground Service with wake-word standby, battery monitoring, and authenticated local Wi-Fi LAN triggers.
- Seamless routing between Gemini Cloud, Gemini Live, and local Ollama over Wi-Fi.
- Local Room database for voice command history, offline commands, memories, and multi-session conversations.
- Remote update delivery via GitHub Releases and official F-Droid repository.
